None of this Finding Nemo CGI craziness.

00:00:46.965 --> 00:00:48.580
- Do you use Snapchat?

00:00:48.580 --> 00:00:50.205
- (laughing) I do not use Snapchat.

00:00:50.205 --> 00:00:51.222
- [Danielle] You do not use Snapchat?

00:00:51.222 --> 00:00:52.170
- No.
- Okay.

00:00:52.170 --> 00:00:55.789
- What was your favorite childhood snack?

00:00:55.789 --> 00:00:58.119
- I'm trying to think. I
liked fruit snacks a lot.

00:00:58.119 --> 00:01:01.601
Who was your favorite band
when you were in high school?

